plugin-qualify (0.18.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * version 0.18.1: the adapter-only pass, and an isolated plugin is offered
  * qualify-sync test: types the lint configuration checks (#192)
  * plugin-qualify-sync --adapter-only, and an isolated plugin is offered
  * qualify-sync: an LV2 plugin is the bundle lilv loads, its record keyed by
    its uri and binary (#199)
  * qualify-sync: a plugin the machine left unmeasured is measured again, and
    a run the machine failed ends failed (#192)
  * version 0.18.1: re-judge the records offline, take the footprints alone
  * README, man page and settings: --rejudge and --memory-only
  * plugin-qualify-sync --rejudge and --memory-only: keep the records through
    an upgrade
  * Probers: OMX_PROBE_MEMORY_ONLY takes the footprint and nothing else (#114)
  * native: a conformance test that the timing runs on the thread whose
    policy the record reads (#214)
  * host-admission: the jalv run ends at its deadline with SIGKILL (#187)
  * plugin-qualify-sync.service: temporary files under its own runtime
    directory (#192)

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:12:02 +0000
